{"connection_id": "BC-a1127dac575e92331f33", "ref": "WLC:Exod.21.14", "target": "sec5", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "murderer taken even from altar", "note": "The commentary contrasts a true exception from ruin with false sanctuary; the law orders a deliberate killer taken even from God's altar for execution."}
