{"connection_id": "BC-a5eb1317c263b09f2f9f", "ref": "WLC:Jer.17.7", "target": "sec5", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "blessed trust in LORD", "note": "The commentary's believer enters security; Jeremiah blesses the one who trusts the LORD as an answer to misplaced reliance on human strength."}
